1
00:00:00,074 --> 00:00:01,341
Bekantan,

2
00:00:01,341 --> 00:00:02,756
maskot Dufan,

3
00:00:02,756 --> 00:00:05,289
ternyata dijuluki "monyet Belanda"...

4
00:00:05,289 --> 00:00:08,706
gara-gara hidung besarnya mirip
orang Belanda zaman penjajahan!

5
00:00:08,706 --> 00:00:11,387
Hidung jantannya bisa lebih dari 10 senti,

6
00:00:11,387 --> 00:00:13,045
menggantung melewati mulut.

7
00:00:13,045 --> 00:00:15,186
Buat apa hidung sebesar itu?

8
00:00:15,186 --> 00:00:16,527
Makin besar hidungnya,

9
00:00:16,527 --> 00:00:18,166
makin besar badannya...

10
00:00:18,166 --> 00:00:20,503
dan makin banyak betina di kelompoknya!

11
00:00:20,503 --> 00:00:23,389
Hidungnya bikin suara
lebih berat saat merayu.

12
00:00:23,389 --> 00:00:24,991
Jadi buat bekantan,

13
00:00:24,991 --> 00:00:26,108
makin mancung...

14
00:00:26,108 --> 00:00:27,300
makin laku!

15
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:27,775
Follow,

16
00:00:27,775 --> 00:00:29,913
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
